  <name>Lian Li Linux</name>
  <summary>Control Lian Li fans, lighting and LCDs</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Configure supported Lian Li hardware through a desktop client and a background daemon.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Configure fan curves, lighting effects and LCD media.</li>
      <li>Display sensor gauges and custom templates.</li>
      <li>Check installation requirements and manage the selected daemon service.</li>
      <li>Use supported LCD panels as desktop displays in a compatible graphical session.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Device features vary by model. Choose a user or system daemon after installation; hardware control is not enabled automatically.</p>
  </description>
  <developer id="io.github.sgtaziz"><name>sgtaziz</name></developer>
